WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.150
Every change is in one list. The count shows how many you have looked at.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.800
Next marks the change you leave as looked at. Looking at a change does not approve it.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.700
Undoing a change that others depend on names them first, so you can undo them together or cancel.

